<title>HONG KONG: China Travel, Sun Fook Kong shares suspended.</title>
<headline>China Travel, Sun Fook Kong shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of China Travel International Investment Hong Kong Ltd and Sun Fook Kong Holdings Ltd was suspended at the companies' request pending announcements, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>Last week, the two companies said they were in talks which could lead to China Travel taking a stake in Sun Fook Kong and launching a general offer.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, China Travel shares ended HK$0.075 lower at HK$4.00 while Sun Fook Kong shares rose HK$0.04 to HK$1.92.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
